  #line-at(271.61pt, 358.13pt, "Abstract ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(114.02pt, 380.57pt, "Gallium-based liquid metals, as a broad category of emerging functional materials ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 396.17pt, "with unique physical, chemical, and biological properties, offer numerous possibilities ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 411.79pt, "for advancing intelligent systems. However, a basic query persistently remains for the ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 427.39pt, "complex liquid metal system: Is there a minimal functional unit that can fully capture ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 442.99pt, "its diversity of morphology and function?")
  #line-at(308.33pt, 442.99pt, "Cells, as the most basic structural and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 458.59pt, "functional units of life, are small in scale but have complex structures, functions, and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 474.19pt, "life activities.")
  #line-at(156.74pt, 474.19pt, "Analogous to nature, this article proposes the concept of liquid metal cells, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 489.79pt, "and systematically explores their construction routes, sensing capabilities, motion ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 505.39pt, "behaviors, and potential applications. We first construct a multi-phase composite ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 520.99pt, "structure with liquid metal as the nucleus, ionic solution as the cytoplasm, and polymer ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 536.59pt, "as the cell membrane by developing a layered cryogenic molding method. Furthermore, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 552.19pt, "we reveal that liquid metal cells exhibit inherently versatile responsive characteristics ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 567.82pt, "and self-adaptive behaviors to thermal, pressure, chemical, electrical, and magnetic ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 583.42pt, "fields, indicating “small world, vast potential”. Based on these fundamental findings, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 599.02pt, "we finally demonstrate the feasibility of utilizing liquid metal cells as sensors, fluidic ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 614.62pt, "valves, and material transport carriers in flow channels through dynamic control.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(90.024pt, 645.94pt, "Keywords")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(141.98pt, 645.94pt, ": Liquid metal; Biomimetic cell; Living matter; Functional unit; Soft matter.  ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 14.04pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(90.024pt, 685.78pt, "1.")
  #line-at(108.02pt, 685.78pt, "Introduction ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(114.02pt, 708.22pt, "Gallium-based room temperature liquid metals have emerged as revolutionary ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 723.82pt, "functional materials that attracted considerable attention due to their unique ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 739.44pt, "physicochemical properties and widespread applications in heat transfer,")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(458.98pt, 734.88pt, "1")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
