  #line-at(431.83pt, 271.37pt, " in replicating ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 286.97pt, "natural life processes. These limitations stem from the fundamental material properties, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 302.57pt, "particularly in energy conversion, multi-field responsiveness, autonomous movement, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 318.17pt, "environmental adaptability, and the scalability of functions and applications.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(454.78pt, 313.61pt, "26-30")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(473.62pt, 318.17pt, " While ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 333.77pt, "these pioneering systems have provided valuable insights into artificial life, their ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 349.37pt, "material constraints often result in compromised performance in one or more of these ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 364.97pt, "critical aspects. ")
  #line-at(114.02pt, 380.57pt, "However, almost all the previously observed bio-like phenomena in liquid metals ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 396.17pt, "occur in centimeter-scale droplets due to the size limitations of surface tension-")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 411.79pt, "dominated fluid manipulation. The autonomous three-dimensional motion and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 427.39pt, "deformation of large-scale liquid metal masses remain technically challenging. This ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 442.99pt, "scale limitation presents a significant constraint when trying to build a new living matter ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 458.59pt, "system compared to natural, which spans from molecular to interacting life. To ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 474.19pt, "overcome this constraint and expand the scale of the liquid metal living matter system, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 489.79pt, "a bottom-up approach is essential.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(258.77pt, 485.23pt, "31")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(266.81pt, 489.79pt, " This approach requires developing fundamental ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 505.39pt, "structural units that both exploit the unique properties of small-scale liquid metals and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 520.99pt, "enable the assembly of larger, more complex functional systems through ordered ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 536.59pt, "organization.  ")
  #line-at(114.02pt, 552.19pt, "Learning from nature, cells are the fundamental structural, functional, and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 567.82pt, "biological units of life. Creating artificial cells with specific sensing capabilities ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 583.42pt, "through laboratory means would represent a significant breakthrough in the field of ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 599.02pt, "artificial life. The natural cellular structure, mainly consisting of a membrane, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 614.74pt, "cytoplasm, and nucleus (")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(207.41pt, 614.74pt, "Fig. 1A")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(244.01pt, 614.74pt, "), provides valuable insights into the liquid metal living ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 630.22pt, "matter system. The realization of liquid metal living matter at various scales can be ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 645.82pt, "approached through the construction of minimal liquid metal cellular units. In this ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 661.42pt, "configuration, liquid metal droplets serve as the nucleus, providing basic perception ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 677.02pt, "and sensing functions. The surrounding aqueous solution acts as cytoplasm, facilitating ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 692.62pt, "interactions between the metallic core and the external environment. The elastic cell ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 708.22pt, "membrane isolates individual liquid metal units while maintaining the dynamical ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 723.82pt, "dominance of the electric double layer over the small-scale liquid metal nucleus, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 739.44pt, "simultaneously allowing material exchange with the environment. It is necessary to ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 755.04pt, "emphasize here that this biosimilar cell structure and component composition also ")
]

