  #line-at(90.024pt, 427.39pt, "resilience, LMCs are subjected to uniform vertical compression at a rate of 2.4 mm/min. ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 442.99pt, "During this time, they rapidly detected the increasing pressure and exhibited enhanced ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 458.71pt, "electrical conductivity properties as a characteristic response ")
