  #line-at(114.02pt, 193.34pt, "Overall, the incorporation of the metallic core fundamentally modifies the system's ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 208.94pt, "thermal behavior through phase change-induced thermal buffering. During the initial ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 224.54pt, "cooling process, the latent heat release rapidly elevates the temperature to 90.76% of ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 240.17pt, "that observed in the blank control group and minimizes to 73.07%. This")
  #line-at(468.94pt, 240.17pt, "thermal ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 255.77pt, "modulation capability enhances the robustness of LMCs, providing improved structural ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 271.37pt, "integrity and functional preservation under extreme environmental conditions, which is ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 286.97pt, "the critical feature for practical applications such as cryopreservation or deployment in ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 302.57pt, "harsh environments. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.56pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(90.024pt, 754.68pt, "Figure 4. Changes in the response characteristics of LMCs under extreme low-temperature ")
