  #line-at(90.024pt, 170.9pt, "7. Dynamic Control of LMCs in Deformed Channels ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(114.02pt, 201.14pt, "The emergence of LMCs represents a pivotal step in transforming liquid metal-")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 216.74pt, "based living matter systems from conceptual frameworks into practical realities. They ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 232.34pt, "provide an extensible, multifunctional platform that potentially expands the structural ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 247.97pt, "and functional possibilities of liquid metals across various domains. To demonstrate ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 263.69pt, "this potential, we showcase their capabilities in deformed channels (")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(426.79pt, 263.69pt, "Fig. 5A")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(465.22pt, 263.69pt, "), where ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 279.17pt, "they function as sensors, valves, and delivery systems, integrating electrical ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 294.77pt, "conductivity, magnetic responsiveness, and morphological adaptability. This ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 310.37pt, "demonstration highlights their environmental adaptability and multifunctionality, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 325.97pt, "illustrating how LMCs can operate effectively in dynamic environments. ")
  #line-at(114.02pt, 341.57pt, "Here we designed a converging-bifurcating channel system with a width gradient ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 357.17pt, "from 12 mm to 6 mm to validate the potential of magnetized LMCs in flow control ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 372.89pt, "applications. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(159.98pt, 372.89pt, "Fig. 5B")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(202.61pt, 372.89pt, " shows the experimental phenomena and corresponding ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 388.37pt, "deformation of LMCs and flow states of this system. In the initial phase, a magnetic ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 403.99pt, "LMC (")
  #set text(font: "Cambria Math", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(123.26pt, 403.99pt, "𝑉")
  #set text(font: "Cambria Math", size: 8.52pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
