#original-page(595.32pt, 841.92pt, none)[
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(293.21pt, 778.08pt, "19 ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(114.02pt, 84.14pt, "Furthermore, by virtue of the extensibility of liquid metal composite material ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 99.74pt, "systems, the LMC can be functionalized with magnetic-tuning ability by incorporating ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 115.34pt, "ferromagnetic particles into the liquid metal core. The magnetic LMCs demonstrate ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 130.94pt, "precise spatiotemporal control over their locomotion and positioning in three-")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 146.54pt, "dimensional space. Such a contactless motion control approach, coupled with the fully ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 162.14pt, "flexible and biocompatible composite structure of LMCs, as well as the viability and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 177.74pt, "versatility of the structural design methodology, jointly endows the LMCs with ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 193.34pt, "navigational ability through adaptive shape modulation. These unique structural and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 208.94pt, "responsive characteristics of LMCs make them particularly promising for applications ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 224.54pt, "in non-uniform channels where wired control is not feasible. Finally, as a practical ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 240.17pt, "illustration, we design a converging-bifurcating channel system with a width gradient ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 255.77pt, "to validate the potential of magnetized LMCs as sensors, valves, and delivery systems. ")
  #line-at(114.02pt, 271.37pt, "In summary, the conceptual establishment, response characterization, and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 286.97pt, "application demonstration of LMCs in this paper provide an initial insight into the ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 302.57pt, "unique features of the liquid metal living matter system. By establishing the ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 318.17pt, "foundational principles of multi-field responsiveness and functional integration in these ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 333.77pt, "engineered constructs, the finding offers a conceptual framework for future ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 349.37pt, "explorations in adaptive materials. However, numerous aspects remain to be explored ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 364.97pt, "to further enhance the intelligence level and expand the survival scenarios. It is crucial ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 380.57pt, "to optimize LMCs’ long-term stability, explore diverse material combinations, and ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 396.17pt, "develop more sophisticated multi-field control strategies. Furthermore, investigating ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 411.79pt, "collective behaviors and interactions among identical LMCs would facilitate their ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 427.39pt, "assembly into higher-order liquid metal functional structures. Through the controlled ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 442.99pt, "fabrication processes we established, developing diverse LMCs with distinct shapes, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 458.59pt, "functions, and adaptabilities would advance this system toward ever higher level ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 474.19pt, "complexity. As reliable basic building blocks, the LMCs offer a solid foundation for ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 489.79pt, "the assembly of more sophisticated liquid metal living matter, potentially leading to ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 505.39pt, "unprecedented applications in various fields.")
